 ('Team stand-up',[('Lead','Has the error been reported?','O erro foi reportado?'),('Dev','Yes, and the cause needs to be addressed.','Sim, e a causa precisa ser tratada.'),('Lead','Should it have been caught earlier?','Deveria ter sido detectado antes?'),('Dev','It should have been checked by a second person.','Deveria ter sido conferido por uma segunda pessoa.')]),
 [('Turn into passive: We must report errors.','Passe.','Errors must be reported.'),('Use should have been + participle.','Use.','It should have been fixed earlier.'),('Say what needs to be done.','Diga.','The cause needs to be addressed.')],
 ('Write 6 rules for a team using passive modality.','Errors must be reported immediately. Every incident should be recorded in the log. The cause needs to be addressed, not only the symptom. Fixes ought to be tested before release. Lessons can be shared in the weekly meeting. Mistakes should not be hidden.',['Usei **passiva modal** 6 vezes'],'6 regras'),
